    "truth": {
      "status": "contract_scenario_over_reviewed_fixtures",
      "basis": "external_mutation stamps the lock at processing time 3.78 s, not capture time 3.75 s. The CLEAR at 8.76 s is 4.98 s later and is not banked; the interval starts at 9.51 s and releases at 14.76 s. With capture time it would bank from 8.76 s and release at 14.01 s, which is what step s09 pins. Expectations were derived step by step from ResultDetector.run, ResultStateMachine, ResultGate and server.record_result, not copied from a replay."
    },
